{"4683090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hyper Warfare", "steam_appid": 4683090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hyper Warfare is an intense multiplayer team-based first-person shooter, delivering fast-paced combat, responsive gunplay, and competitive action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into battle with your squad, choose your loadout, and dominate the battlefield in dynamic matches where every second counts. Whether you prefer close-range aggression or long-distance precision, Hyper Warfare offers multiple playstyles to match your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in thrilling matches where two teams spawn at separate locations and fight for dominance. Even when players are missing, intelligent bots ensure that matches stay full and action-packed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select your weapons, and prove your skills in non-stop combat.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hyper Warfare is an intense multiplayer team-based first-person shooter, delivering fast-paced combat, responsive gunplay, and competitive action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into battle with your squad, choose your loadout, and dominate the battlefield in dynamic matches where every second counts. Whether you prefer close-range aggression or long-distance precision, Hyper Warfare offers multiple playstyles to match your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in thrilling matches where two teams spawn at separate locations and fight for dominance. Even when players are missing, intelligent bots ensure that matches stay full and action-packed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select your weapons, and prove your skills in non-stop combat.</p>", "short_description": "Fast-paced multiplayer t